message.content:
{
  "answer_markdown": "If a Workspace in Studio reaches its monthly spending limit, API access for that Workspace is suspended until the next month begins or an admin increases the limit. If recent invoice payments fail, access can also be affected until the payments are processed again [1, 2, 4].\n\nA Workspace spending limit cannot exceed the Organization spending limit, regardless of whether the Workspace limit is higher or not [1, 4, 6]. This is enforced at both the UI and API key policy level, and any attempt to set a Workspace limit above the Organization limit will be blocked [5, 6].\n\nTo configure a Workspace spending limit, follow these steps:\n\n```\n1. Open [Admin Panel > Administration > Workspaces](https://admin.mistral.ai/organization/workspaces).\n2. Select the Workspace.\n3. Open the **Settings** tab.\n4. Set **Monthly spending limit**.\n5. Save your changes.\n```\n\nThis is documented in [2] and [4].\n\nTo set or update the Organization spending limit using the Admin API, use the following command:\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST https://api.mistral.ai/v1/admin/spend-limit \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: $ADMIN_API_KEY\" \\\n  -d '{\"amount\": 500, \"no_monthly_limit\": false}'\n```\n\nThis is documented in [7].",
  "citations": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "If the Organization reaches its monthly spending limit, API access can be suspended until the next month begins or an admin increases the limit. If recent invoice payments fail, access can also be affected until the payments are processed again."
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "quote": "If a Workspace reaches its monthly spending limit, API access for that Workspace is suspended until the next month begins or an admin increases the limit. If recent invoice payments fail, access can also be affected until the payments are processed again."
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "quote": "If a Workspace reaches its monthly spending limit, API access for that Workspace is suspended until the next month begins or the limit is increased."
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "quote": "The Organization maximum becomes the effective ceiling for newly created API keys. Workspace Admins can still set stricter limits, but they cannot exceed the Organization maximum."
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "quote": "The Organization policy is the ceiling. Workspace limits can be stricter, but they cannot exceed the Organization maximum."
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "quote": "curl -X POST https://api.mistral.ai/v1/admin/spend-limit \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: $ADMIN_API_KEY\" \\\n  -d '{\"amount\": 500, \"no_monthly_limit\": false}'"
    }
  ],
  "insufficient_evidence": false
}

