  "name": "vibe-api-key",
  "expiration": null,
  "workspace_uuid": "<WORKSPACE_UUID>",
  "user_id": "<USER_ID>"
}
```

The key must be created in the target Workspace using the Admin API [16].

> **Note**:
> - The `mistral_code_user` role grants access to Vibe and its features but does not include any management or administration privileges [1].
> - The API key is scoped to the Workspace and adheres to its quota and rate limits [3].",
