For POST /v1/chat/classifications, the required fields in the ChatClassificationRequest body are:

1. **`model` (string, required)** — ID of the model to use.
2. **`input` (ChatClassificationRequestInputs, required)** — Chat to classify, which can be one of:
   - An array of `InstructRequest` objects
   - A single `InstructRequest` object

The `InstructRequest` object must contain at least one `message` with a `role` and `content` field.

### Required Code Example
```json
{
  "model": "mistral-medium-latest",
  "input": {
    "messages": [
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "I love this product!"
      }
    ]
  }
}
